          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "SC and ST students can find free or subsidised skill courses through government skilling programmes, state corporations, industrial training institutes and some employers, and the best choice is a course that is recognised, linked to real local jobs and clear about what is free."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check official skilling portals and your state welfare office, pick a recognised course tied to local jobs and keep your documents ready."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Read the current official notice and never pay an agent for admission."
          }
        ]
      },
